# PDCA cycle workspace: cycle evidence stays local, while the cycle status files
# (.pdca/status/<task>-<N>.md, the source of truth for plan and progress) are
# versioned, as are the scripts CI and the skills execute.
/.pdca/*
!/.pdca/scripts/
!/.pdca/status/
